hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"341","A chapter on haste in travel: Ibn al-Musaffa narrated to us, Abu al-Mughirah informed us, Hariz ibn Uthman narrated to us, from Habib ibn Ubayd, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), when returning from his raids and detachments, used to hasten on account of the scantiness of provisions."
